  "description": "Summer Sticker Bundle\nYou will Receive the Following Formats:\n– SVG\n– DXF\n– PNG (Transparent)\n– EPS\nIncluded Design text:\n– Hello Sunshine\n– Summer Vibes\n– Sunrise Sunburn Sunset Repeat\n– Here Comes The Sun\n– Hello summer\n– Beach Therapy\n– No One Likes A Shady Beach\n– Resting Beach Face\n– Meet Me At The Beach\n– Mermaid Squad\n– Life Is Better At The Beach\n– Life’s A Beach Enjoys The Waves\n– Vacay Mode\n– Chasing Sunshine\n– Hello Sweet Summer\nThe design is perfect on t-shirts, notebook covers, packaging, mugs, laptops, decorating, paper crafts, tumblers, card decoration and much more! You can also use the design with Cricut, Silhouette, Scrapbooking, Vinyl decals and other cutting machines.\nThank you and enjoy your shopping.",
